// MSPro V18: GS1 / GSCS19, both in the V18 map group.
0
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
// Map Servers
// Each map server: its code, its group, its address and its port.
//   Server code: The code of the server (the ServerCode of its GameServer). It cannot be negative.
//   Server group: The group of map servers it belongs to, 0 to 19. Players move between servers of the same group.
//   Initial value: -1, 0 or 1: how the server starts out for the maps that no route says anything about (1 keeps them here).
//   IP address: Starts with S, for example S192.168.1.10.
//   Port: The port of the GameServer.
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~32767]     [0~19]         [-1~1]        [Text]        [1~65535]
//  ServerCode    ServerGroup    InitSetVal    IPAddress     Port
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
    1             1              1             S127.0.0.1    55903
    19            1              0             S127.0.0.1    55904
end

1
//-----------------------------------------------------------
// Map Routes
// The map servers a map leads to: players that go to the map are sent to the next server.
//   Server code: The server this route is for.
//   Move option: 0 The map is sent to the next server | 1 The map cannot be left from this server
//   Map: The map this route is for.
//   Next server code: The server that takes the players of the map. -1 means this same server.
//-----------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]      [0~1]            [Number]    [Number]
//  ServerCode    NotMoveOption    NextMap     NextServerCode
//-----------------------------------------------------------
    1             0                30          19
    1             0                31          19
    1             0                34          19
    1             0                41          19
    1             0                42          19
    1             0                79          19
    19            1                30          -1
    19            1                31          -1
    19            1                34          -1
    19            1                41          -1
    19            1                42          -1
    19            1                79          -1
end
